        "created_at": "2013-07-15T03:45:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, you can disregard my guide. The new ruling means that her advanced rule will only apply once when she's on side B so just fight her like you would on normal. She's not really any harder on advanced side B. You'll just take like one or two more damage than you would have before. I am not particularly happy with the ruling, but I don't have the money to be a playtester so my opinion should count very little.</p>",
