      {
        "id": 60105,
        "name": "pppery",
        "username": "pppery",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/3d9bf3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-29T22:46:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"j1hopki1\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> j1hopki1:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;…Whenever, La Capitan takes damage return 1 card under her to the appropriate trash. If you do, she regains that much health.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This would create two issues:</p>\n<ol><li>What if hp recovery was reduced or increased.This could be fixed by saying....\"If you do, restore her to x hp, where x is her current health + the amount of damage taken</li><li>What would happen if La capitain would be dealt more damage than her current hp. This could be fixed by adding \"If there are cards under this card, la capitain is indestructible\"</li></ol>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
